          "component": "Text",
          "variant": "h3",
          "text": "Day 3: Akihabara & Ueno - Anime, Tech, and Science"
        },
        {
          "id": "day-3-meta",
          "component": "Text",
          "variant": "caption",
          "text": "Date: 2025-06-12 (Thursday) | Neighborhood: Akihabara, Ueno | Theme: Anime Hub, Electronics, Kid-friendly Museums"
        },
        {
          "id": "day-3-img",
          "component": "Image",
          "url": "/assets/akihabara_electric_town.jpg",
          "variant": "largeFeature",
          "fit": "cover"
        },
        {
          "id": "day-3-activities-header",
          "component": "Text",
          "variant": "h4",
          "text": "Activities"
        },
        {
          "id": "day-3-activities",
          "component": "List",
          "direction": "vertical",
          "children": [
            "day-3-act-1",
            "day-3-act-2",
            "day-3-act-3"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "day-3-act-1",
          "component": "Text",
          "text": "Morning: Dive into Akihabara Electric Town. Explore anime and manga shops, electronics stores, and themed cafes. Kids might enjoy the arcades."
        },
        {
          "id": "day-3-act-2",
          "component": "Text",
          "text": "Afternoon: Head to Ueno Park. Choose one kid-friendly museum: the National Museum of Nature and Science (interactive exhibits) or the Ueno Zoo."
        },
        {
          "id": "day-3-act-3",
          "component": "Text",
          "text": "Evening: Enjoy dinner in Ueno or Akihabara, perhaps trying a themed restaurant in Akihabara."
        },
        {
          "id": "day-3-attractions-header",
          "component": "Text",
          "variant": "h4",
          "text": "Key Attractions"
        },
        {
          "id": "day-3-attractions",
          "component": "List",
          "direction": "vertical",
          "children": [
            "day-3-attr-1",
            "day-3-attr-2",
            "day-3-attr-3"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "day-3-attr-1",
          "component": "Text",
          "text": "Akihabara Electric Town: The center for Japanese anime, manga, video games, and electronics."
        },
        {
          "id": "day-3-attr-2",
          "component": "Text",
          "text": "National Museum of Nature and Science (Ueno): Features engaging exhibits on science and natural history, including dinosaurs."
        },
        {
          "id": "day-3-attr-3",
          "component": "Text",
          "text": "Ueno Zoo: Home to pandas and various other animals, a popular choice for families."
        },
        {
          "id": "day-3-cost",
          "component": "Text",
          "variant": "body",
          "text": "Estimated Cost (Family of 4): USD 380 (Transport: $50, Meals: $230, Activities: $100)"
        },
