        {
          "id": "day-5-act-1",
          "component": "Text",
          "text": "Morning: Explore Asakusa. Visit Senso-ji Temple, Tokyo's oldest temple, and stroll through Nakamise-dori market for traditional snacks and souvenirs."
        },
        {
          "id": "day-5-act-2",
          "component": "Text",
          "text": "Afternoon: Travel to Tokyo Station and explore Tokyo Character Street, an underground mall filled with official shops for popular Japanese characters (Pokemon, Studio Ghibli, Sanrio, Jump Shop, etc.)."
        },
        {
          "id": "day-5-act-3",
          "component": "Text",
          "text": "Evening: Optional: Ascend Tokyo Skytree for a final breathtaking view of the city. Enjoy a farewell dinner."
        },
        {
          "id": "day-5-attractions-header",
